{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV戀愛真人騷《直樂VIURIETY》近日加入30歲美妝YouTuber Ding Ding惹來極大迴響，更一開場就被男參賽者狠狠貼上「心機女」負面標籤。這位擁有14年資歷的網紅近年屢爆公關災難，由接拍高達十萬元報價廣告到身邊人際關係大洗牌都備受爭議。昔日清純偶像如今淪為網民圍攻對象，背後連串...</p>\n<p>\nViuTV戀愛真人騷《直樂<b><strong>VIURIETY</strong></b>》近日加入30歲美妝YouTuber Ding Ding惹來極大迴響，更一開場就被男參賽者狠狠貼上「心機女」負面標籤。這位擁有14年資歷的網紅近年屢爆公關災難，由接拍高達十萬元報價廣告到身邊人際關係大洗牌都備受爭議。昔日清純偶像如今淪為網民圍攻對象，背後連串是非與隱秘情史終於被徹底翻出。\n</p>\n<h2>與昔日好姊妹SueChang決裂反面內幕</h2>\n<p>曾幾何時Ding Ding與知名網紅Sue Chang組成的組合紅極一時，惟二人於2018年至2019年間突然漸行漸遠並全面終止合作。當時網上充斥各種傳聞，有指牽涉另一網紅引發三角關係糾紛，後來更有KOL大爆內幕暗示這段友誼存在大蝦細情況。該爆料直指Sue在相處時過於強勢主導，令對方感受到被嚴重冷落與疏遠，雖然當事人從未正面證實這段恩怨情仇，但兩人形同陌路的結局已成為網民持續關注的熱話。</p>\n<h2>Ding Ding頻繁接廣告慘遭網民狠批爛面</h2>\n<p>隨著名氣攀升與商業價值暴漲，這位初代美妝達人近年瘋狂接下各大品牌贊助，卻因過度商業化惹來海量負評。有網民在討論區發文直斥「Ding Ding已經變咗全職賣廣告，咩都話好用」，大批觀眾亦狠批她皮膚狀態極差卻不斷推銷護膚品，留言抨擊「定對佢公司產品，你塊面爛成咁⋯點信你啊⋯」以及「佢仲要爛面，成面暗瘡都出嚟賣護膚品」。就連日常旅遊Vlog也被揭發植入大量廣告台詞，甚至聯同朋友一起演戲宣傳。</p>\n<h2>曾與《全民造星5》選手秘戀</h2>\n<p>除了充滿爭議的網紅事業與閨密恩怨，其私人感情生活同樣具備極高討論度，更牽涉ViuTV另一人氣節目《全民造星5》參賽者。網上多個討論區曾瘋傳她與樂隊ROVER隊長兼低音結他手Kim關係匪淺，有粉絲更指認出Ding Ding影片中出現的男友與Kim的背景和身型都吻合，兩人從未為這段戀情回應，據悉兩人已分手。</p>\n<h2>網民群起嘲諷直指氣場變得極度虛偽</h2>\n<p>面對排山倒海的負面新聞與節目上的爭議畫面，大批網民對其現況毫不留情地給予嚴厲批評。不少昔日觀眾留言感嘆「同啊sue分開後，覺得佢愈黎愈差成個氣場係虛偽」，並直指她無論對待朋友還是面對鏡頭都顯得空洞且缺乏誠意。有網民更表態「真係唔知有咩理由睇佢」，坦言寧願觀看其他離地富貴KOL，也無法接受一個失去真誠並被廣告徹底反噬的網絡紅人。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17909163868577071_6497628186abf372338e77.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 （圖片來源：IG@ding_2）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17909163868577071_6497628186abf372338e77.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091655304819812_21269493646abf37c974d2d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 Ding Ding參加ViuTv戀愛真人騷（圖片來源：ViuTv）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091655304819812_21269493646abf37c974d2d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ding Ding參加ViuTv戀愛真人騷（圖片來源：ViuTv）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091655471241573_11025496856abf37cb223c8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 被指心機女（圖片來源：ViuTv）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091655471241573_11025496856abf37cb223c8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>被指心機女（圖片來源：ViuTv）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091638985793567_5594875406abf372639df8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 Ding Ding參加ViuTv戀愛真人騷（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091638985793567_5594875406abf372639df8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ding Ding參加ViuTv戀愛真人騷（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091639122051943_7125882816abf3727cbc36.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 （圖片來源：IG@ding_2）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091639122051943_7125882816abf3727cbc36.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091639297642972_8648626776abf372a0eee5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 （圖片來源：IG@ding_2）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091639297642972_8648626776abf372a0eee5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091639592578448_4315635826abf372c5285a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 （圖片來源：IG@ding_2）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091639592578448_4315635826abf372c5285a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091639774259614_12971594016abf372e8d5b5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 （圖片來源：IG@ding_2）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091639774259614_12971594016abf372e8d5b5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091640010180316_7402598546abf373069e62.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 曾與Youtuber Sue Cheung是好姊妹（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091640010180316_7402598546abf373069e62.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>曾與Youtuber Sue Cheung是好姊妹（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091640127893141_20966916696abf37322fa7a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 一齊合拍《SueDing TV》（圖片來源：Youtube@Ding Ding）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091640127893141_20966916696abf37322fa7a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>一齊合拍《SueDing TV》（圖片來源：Youtube@Ding Ding）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091640435817814_12964218846abf373502c54.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 IG上充滿廣告（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091640435817814_12964218846abf373502c54.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>IG上充滿廣告（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17909164075783430_8580602706abf3737e1943.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 IG上充滿廣告（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17909164075783430_8580602706abf3737e1943.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>IG上充滿廣告（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091640938490290_5445922436abf3739ec838.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 IG上充滿廣告（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091640938490290_5445922436abf3739ec838.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>IG上充滿廣告（圖片來源：IG@ding_2）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091641237019438_18597178496abf373d0acdd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 Ding Ding被指影片中出現的男友與Kim的背景和身型都吻合（圖片來源：Youtube@Ding Ding）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091641237019438_18597178496abf373d0acdd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ding Ding被指影片中出現的男友與Kim的背景和身型都吻合（圖片來源：Youtube@Ding Ding）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091641469193429_697827396abf373f38526.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 《全民造星5》Kim（圖片來源：IG@kimcheuk0303）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091641469193429_697827396abf373f38526.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>《全民造星5》Kim（圖片來源：IG@kimcheuk0303）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091641606470438_14874681166abf37406d82d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁 直樂 《全民造星5》Kim（圖片來源：IG@kimcheuk0303）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179091641606470438_14874681166abf37406d82d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>《全民造星5》Kim（圖片來源：IG@kimcheuk0303）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T17:40:47.316443+00:0